  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Prospectus Summary",
      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 1 \u200b \u200b MARKET PRICE AND DIVIDEND INFORMATION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 13 \u200b \u200b RISK FACTORS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 14 \u200b \u200b CAUTIONARY NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 99 \u200b \u200b THE SPECIAL MEETING OF NEXTCURE STOCKHOLDERS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 102 \u200b \u200b THE MERGER \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 106 \u200b \u200b THE MERGER AGREEMENT \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 143 \u200b \u200b AGREEMENTS RELATED TO THE MERGER \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 164 \u200b \u200b NEXTCURE DIRECTORS, OFFICERS AND CORPORATE GOVERNANCE \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 168 \u200b \u200b NEXTCURE EXECUTIVE OFFICER AND DIRECTOR COMPENSATION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 177 \u200b \u200b NEXTCURE EQUITY COMPENSATION PLAN INFORMATION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 186 \u200b \u200b AVERE EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 187 \u200b \u200b AVERE DIRECTOR COMPENSATION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 189 \u200b \u200b MATTERS BEING SUBMITTED TO A VOTE OF NEXTCURE STOCKHOLDERS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 190 \u200b \u200b PROPOSAL NO. 1\u2009\u2014\u2009THE NASDAQ STOCK ISSUANCE PROPOSAL \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 190 \u200b \u200b PROPOSAL NO. 2\u2009\u2014\u2009THE NASDAQ CHANGE OF CONTROL PROPOSAL \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 192 \u200b \u200b PROPOSAL NO. 3\u2009\u2014\u2009THE AUTHORIZED SHARE IN",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "RISK FACTORS The combined company will be faced with a market environment that cannot be predicted and that involves significant risks, many of which will be beyond its control. In addition to the other information contained in this proxy statement/prospectus, you should carefully consider the material risks described below before deciding how to vote your shares of NextCure common stock. You should also read and consider the other information in this proxy statement/prospectus. Please see the section titled \u201c Where You Can Find More Information \u201d beginning on page 393 of this proxy statement/prospectus for further information. Risks Related to the Merger Failure to complete, or delays in completing, the Merger could materially and adversely affect NextCure\u2019s and Avere\u2019s results of operations, business, financial results and/or common stock price. Consummation of the Merger is subject to",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
